ing=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Outfit_Yalaharian_Female_f9af81.gif\" width=\"64\"/></span>\n</td>\n<td><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Outfit Yalaharian Female Addon 1\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Outfit_Yalaharian_Female_Addon_1_1cc0c0.gif\" width=\"64\"/></span>\n</td>\n<td><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Outfit Yalaharian Female Addon 2\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Outfit_Yalaharian_Female_Addon_2_ffcf6f.gif\" width=\"64\"/></span>\n</td>\n<td><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Outfit Yalaharian Female Addon 3\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Outfit_Yalaharian_Female_Addon_3_2ce6d4.gif\" width=\"128\"/></span>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-outfit-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>This outfit stands for a Yalahari citizen.<br/>\nAlthough both addons of this outfit can't be unlocked at the same time by regular players, CipSoft characters can wear both addons at once as seen on the screenshots below taken from Tibia.com's Screenshots section. Also obtaining either of the addons will unlock the achievement <a href=\"#/wiki/Yalahari%20of%20Wisdom\">Yalahari of Wisdom</a> or <a href=\"#/wiki/Yalahari%20of%20Power\">Yalahari of Power</a>.\n</p>\n<div class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-center wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-center wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\" data-seq-no=\"0\" hash=\"d64af30c7f69232ea5837b53a6599a9e\" id=\"w-gallery-0\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:138px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"w-Yalahar_Screenshot-png\" style=